      "en": "hereby participate with their colleagues the town leaders[NOTE:1] and enter into a curse and an oath[NOTE:2] to adhere to[NOTE:3] the law of God which was given through Moses the servant of God, and to obey[NOTE:4] carefully all the commandments of the Lord our Lord,[NOTE:5] along with his ordinances and his statutes.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “the nobles.”",
